{"4349660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Almost A Ghost", "steam_appid": 4349660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Almost a Ghost is a grid-based puzzle game inspired by classic Sokoban, expanded with modern mechanics and a subtle theme about becoming real.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You control a character who longs to become a true ghost.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Push boxes, solve puzzles, and watch out for deadly laser beams.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Remember — you are not a real ghost yet.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A wide variety of carefully designed levels built on clean, readable grids await you.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sliding ice blocks, explosive boxes, slippery floors, teleporting portals, deadly laser beams, and breakable paths offer a fresh take on traditional Sokoban-style puzzles.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mechanics are introduced gradually and reinforced over time. Everything you learn may return in later puzzles, asking you to plan ahead and combine systems thoughtfully as challenges grow more demanding.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Undo and reset tools allow you to experiment with different solutions and rethink your approach. As you near the end, nothing will stand between you and becoming a real ghost.</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Almost a Ghost is a grid-based puzzle game inspired by classic Sokoban, expanded with modern mechanics and a subtle theme about becoming real.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You control a character who longs to become a true ghost.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Push boxes, solve puzzles, and watch out for deadly laser beams.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Remember — you are not a real ghost yet.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A wide variety of carefully designed levels built on clean, readable grids await you.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sliding ice blocks, explosive boxes, slippery floors, teleporting portals, deadly laser beams, and breakable paths offer a fresh take on traditional Sokoban-style puzzles.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mechanics are introduced gradually and reinforced over time. Everything you learn may return in later puzzles, asking you to plan ahead and combine systems thoughtfully as challenges grow more demanding.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Undo and reset tools allow you to experiment with different solutions and rethink your approach. As you near the end, nothing will stand between you and becoming a real ghost.</strong></h2>", "short_description": "Almost a Ghost is a grid-based, Sokoban-inspired puzzle game about a spirit caught between worlds. Push boxes, master evolving mechanics, and work your way toward becoming real.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Turkish, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349660/c8c24926cc556d67f704d1746f7c6493bc3fdf64/header.jpg?t=1783865782", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349660/4fd94822c5cf6b8b40a7a71b63cfa908ea4b298b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783865782", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349660/4fd94822c5cf6b8b40a7a71b63cfa908ea4b298b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783865782", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 6500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></l